{"id":"ea2f75bb398fde09","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-radon-nikodym.md","title":"Radon–Nikodym Theorem","display":"thm-radon-nikodym — Radon–Nikodym Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-radon-nikodym","aliases":["58-thm-radon-nikodym"],"display":"thm-radon-nikodym — Radon–Nikodym Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-radon-nikodym"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-radon-nikodym</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-radon-nikodym — Radon–Nikodym Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" href=\"?note=fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md\">../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad78f775172312be\" href=\"?note=ad78f775172312be\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\nu,f,g,\\mathcal B_+\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\nu,f,g,\\mathcal B_+\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+\">\\(\\mathcal B_+\\)</span> is the Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,\\infty]\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the semicolon-grouped measurable-function predicate</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B_+)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B_+)\\)</span>，取所引内部通常实拓扑文件唯一确定的结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_A f\\,d\\mu\">\\(\\int_A f\\,d\\mu\\)</span> 是所引非负积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in\\Sigma\\)</span> 上的原三元记号，不是未定义的限制积分。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}radon\\text{-}nikodym}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu,\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\Sigma),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\forall g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\Sigma),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A g\\,d\\mu)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\to\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}radon\\text{-}nikodym}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu,\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\Sigma),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\forall g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\Sigma),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A g\\,d\\mu)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\to\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The exact upstream sigma-finite and measurable-function predicates are used; the latter already contains the required set-function guard.</li>\n<li>The density <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=d\\nu/d\\mu\">\\(f=d\\nu/d\\mu\\)</span> is nonnegative and unique up to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-almost-everywhere equality.</li>\n<li>Every integral occurrence is guarded by the same sigma-finite measure space and by a measurable map into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\">\\(([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\)</span>, matching the nonnegative-integral interface.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ad78f775172312be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\nu,f,g,\\mathcal B_+\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B_+)","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_A f\\,d\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}radon\\text{-}nikodym}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu,\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\Sigma),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\mu)\\\\\n&\\hspace{6em}\\land\\forall g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\Sigma),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\nu(A)=\\int_A g\\,d\\mu)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}\\to\n\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f=d\\nu/d\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)","display":false}],"bytes":2189,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4381","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-radon-nikodym.md|58-thm-radon-nikodym]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["3b5b3d48ff1ff369","ca832ed6bc22f728","fc3c1d6f4dc7038c","ad78f775172312be","bbbec05fde1d3b01","4884f45058a56aac"]}